========================================================================================
LRC(14) global-threshold ladder: rho_alpha(P,E)
========================================================================================
Definitions: G_P={x: ||p x||>=1/14 for all p in P};
rho_alpha(P,E)=meas(G_P cap {maxgap({e*x})>alpha}).
alpha=2/7 is the old via-max sufficient condition; alpha=1/7 is the
global witness threshold.  All decisions below use Fraction arithmetic.

